From 46266b16741fd43be6efde63c809178e7207f29f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mohamed Ashry <contact@atharapp.download>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 12:03:59 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 4/7] feat(ui): export the layout size family and show every DS
 v2 token family in stories
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

sizes.ts names its 23-token layout family (DS v2 §4.5) as layoutSizeNames, so a
story or doc can show it without meaning every bench fact. Tokens.stories gains
tints with their ink, the scrim over a plate, the eight lines, the layer table,
the three half-steps and the layout sizes, each through FourCorners so both
themes and both directions are reviewed. The Spacing story now names half-steps
with a dash (--warsha-space-1-5), and Button's size comment states what DS v2
published. No pixel moves.
---
